<%#
    The main view: a rail of tabs, the current tab, and the play bar.

    The Play tab is drawn here: a slideshow of the lobby (shell.js), the selected server as the
    headline, and a dock with the challenges and news cards. The Challenges, Stats and News tabs
    show the configured website in webviews that shell.js creates on first use. The play bar stays
    under every tab, so the game can be launched from anywhere.

    landing.js, uicore.js and uibinder.js rely on these ids: launch_*, server_selection_button,
    player_count, mojang_*, avatarContainer, avatarOverlay, user_text, settingsMediaButton and
    image_seal_container.
%>
<%
